{"title":"2005 CEMC Hypatia Problems/Problem 1b","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1\"><a href=\"#Problem_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Verifying_Solutions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Verifying Solutions</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_1\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_CEMC_Hypatia_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2005 CEMC Hypatia Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_CEMC_Hypatia_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />, the notation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/4/9d4321dbea9f298dfe9c114d4c440694632bed8a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a \\diamond b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"36\" height=\"14\" /> means <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c30d05e56161d6ef29d2514560e67f60d593dac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^{2} - 4b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"58\" height=\"18\" />. For example, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/3/a7301c9a7acd5239967ae52397b000ddc70c1760.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5 \\diamond 3 = 5^{2} - 4(3) = 13$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"175\" height=\"21\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_CEMC_Hypatia_Problems/Problem_1b&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Find all values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/9/4e9172f97d0452bdbcc1805a5e49edd5520b5324.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 \\diamond k = k \\diamond 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"99\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_CEMC_Hypatia_Problems/Problem_1b&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can equate <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/d/c0dd8e9512440cc6395b11773c28049b8fe38d47.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k \\diamond 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/d/f2d091476817797d8589ca08fe7e5e0f730a8681.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 \\diamond k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" /> and use <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/d/bfd176b0b9edd8e714c0b6e9b0e37e60b9ed7124.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a \\diamond b = a^2 - 4b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"117\" height=\"18\" />:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/6/8/46848fee7914a47ec9d532de112a53d8b9d2ea9c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k \\diamond 2 = 2 \\diamond k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"99\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/5/f455b6bb015dc0e418ca860cb7f2e3dff2a5b88e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k^{2} - 4(2) = 2^{2} - 4k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"156\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/1/071fb13fd01397235d8de53fd245309fdaba3059.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k^{2} - 8 = 4 - 4k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"125\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/5/b45bd472aad172f8dd1768faefa54c0d841b064a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k^{2} + 4k - 8 - 4 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"157\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/3/c1344251b087517613e152348c6902303a281d78.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k^{2} + 4k - 12 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"134\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>We can realize that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/a/62a76677add1d246708c86edfc7c4b8a40184914.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"25\" height=\"15\" /> multiply to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/a/dcadf6b880a738849845ef4a0bb57403e9898359.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-12$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"31\" height=\"12\" /> and add to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. Thus, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/e/b3ee8fd893fbbaf695e47f05e00c42673abacd17.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k^{2} + 6k - 2k - 12 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"176\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/a/80afaeb916315b3db870707ac60a7c9ff62c06e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k(k + 6) - 2(k + 6) = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"187\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/1/6a11be8e67efdad1a4b8a15411000072c2cb127a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(k - 2)(k + 6) = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"146\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>Either <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/8/e88e284d44aed05f632d53f1ebfed111175e5930.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k - 2 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"77\" height=\"16\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/d/01da446ff3e347646dcbfd8d89356da7288e2dd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k + 6 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"77\" height=\"16\" /> for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/5/8f59724b7e616bc1cbb8d882364588657a3e5ce1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(k - 2)(k + 6)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"113\" height=\"20\" /> to be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. Thus:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/9/5/59515de0d14779d586c4c128d2ba94fbc87afc8a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{k = 2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"56\" height=\"26\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/a/a5a12c2ba5ab2623f4b95aacf792abb79db8d3d0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{k = -6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -8px\" width=\"71\" height=\"27\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Verifying_Solutions\">Verifying Solutions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_CEMC_Hypatia_Problems/Problem_1b&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Verifying Solutions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In the solution, we got <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/4/8e44ca2cae6be42148fe1b1fd8b5d55bd6b599bd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k = 2$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/3/a03821d3fb69aa7e6ce5063f494a328a41f43c0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k = -6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"59\" height=\"16\" /> as answers.\n</p><p>First, we can find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/d/c0dd8e9512440cc6395b11773c28049b8fe38d47.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k \\diamond 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/d/f2d091476817797d8589ca08fe7e5e0f730a8681.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 \\diamond k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" /> when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/4/8e44ca2cae6be42148fe1b1fd8b5d55bd6b599bd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k = 2$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" />, and see if those are equal.\n</p><p>We realize that they are because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/8/cb86512dd6504aac36b2972c491e28ab6584d413.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 \\diamond 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"37\" height=\"14\" /> would be equal to itself, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/4/8e44ca2cae6be42148fe1b1fd8b5d55bd6b599bd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k = 2$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" /> works as a solution.\n</p><p>Next, we can find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/d/c0dd8e9512440cc6395b11773c28049b8fe38d47.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k \\diamond 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/d/f2d091476817797d8589ca08fe7e5e0f730a8681.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 \\diamond k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" /> when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/3/a03821d3fb69aa7e6ce5063f494a328a41f43c0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k = -6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"59\" height=\"16\" />, and see if those are equal.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/a/43a5cf8f4e48696b68eaac1c9464430161238053.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-6 \\diamond 2 = (-6)^{2} - 4 \\times 2 = 36 - 8 = 28$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"299\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/a/10acb04cba07be463acf858e880dd26e4b202bb7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 \\diamond -6 = 2^{2} - 4 \\times - 6 = 4 + 24 = 28$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"285\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>These are equal, so we see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/3/a03821d3fb69aa7e6ce5063f494a328a41f43c0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k = -6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"59\" height=\"16\" /> also does work as a solution.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017205448\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.026 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.163 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 182/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 300/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 7465/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    